  "_approach": "Amen roll-up: bar 1 states a compact amen groove (kick on 1 and the and-of-3, snare 2/4 with a-of-2 and e-of-3 ghosts, ride eighths); bar 2 is the tape-edit roll-up so beloved of 90s junglists - the snare accelerates 8ths -> 16ths -> 32nds with velocity climbing to 127 while the kick drops out and the ride/hats fade, leaving the last 32nd silent as the drop hits. Ref: Remarc/Dillinja-style amen edits, the roll-up documented in KAN Samples' Amen-chopping guide.",
